# iPad deploy / signing / backup

Canonical commands + Vietnamese notes: `ipad-app/scripts/COMMANDS.md`.

## What to use when

| Goal | Do this |
|------|---------|
| Code update on real iPad | `ipad-app/scripts/deploy-ipad.sh` (`DEVICE_UDID` required). Fast incremental — **no clean**, no DerivedData wipe. |
| Free cert / profile expiry (~7d) | `ipad-app/scripts/renew-ipad-signing.sh` (`DEVICE_UDID` + `TEAM`). Optional LaunchAgent: `com.youtubejpcaptionstudio.renew.plist` every 12h. |
| Persist data across reinstall | In-app **Thư mục** / **Backup** / **Restore** → Google Drive via Files (`BackupService`, file `caption-studio-backup.json`). |
| First physical install | Manual Xcode Automatic Signing + Trust — see `ipad-app/scripts/FIRST_RUN.md`. |

## Hard rules

- **Never delete the app** on the iPad just to update or resign — that wipes the SwiftData sandbox. Overwrite install (same Bundle ID) only.
- Prefer `deploy-ipad.sh` for day-to-day code; prefer `renew-ipad-signing.sh` for signing-only refresh.
- Wireless works after one pair: same Wi‑Fi, unlocked iPad, same `DEVICE_UDID`.
- UDID: `xcrun xctrace list devices` (or Xcode Devices → Identifier).
